{"id":"seongsan-ilchulbong","name":"Seongsan Ilchulbong","qid":"Q122225","country":"South Korea","locality":"Jeju Province","lat":"33.45805556","lon":"126.9425","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"Natural Monument of South Korea; part of UNESCO World Heritage Site","type":"mountain; natural monument; protected area","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seongsan_Ilchulbong","text":"Seongsan Ilchulbong (Korean: 성산일출봉), also called Sunrise Peak, is a volcano on eastern Jeju Island, in Seongsan-ri, Seogwipo, Jeju Province, South Korea. It is 182 meters high and has a volcanic crater at the top. Considered one of South Korea's most beautiful tourist sites, it is famed for being the easternmost mountain on Jeju, and thus the best spot on the island to see the first sunrise of the year.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seongsan_Ilchulbong","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-ae03e463de91","w":1200,"h":782,"title":"Seongsan Ilchulbong from the air.jpg","o":"gh-ae03e463de91.jpg","credit":{"text":"Korea.net / Korean Culture and Information Service","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seongsan_Ilchulbong_from_the_air.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}},{"id":"gh-d2ae08fff2e2","w":1200,"h":801,"title":"성산일출봉 천연보호구역 2019년 촬영(출처 문화재청 대변인실).jpg","o":"gh-d2ae08fff2e2.jpg","credit":{"text":"Korea Heritage Service","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EC%84%B1%EC%82%B0%EC%9D%BC%EC%B6%9C%EB%B4%89_%EC%B2%9C%EC%97%B0%EB%B3%B4%ED%98%B8%EA%B5%AC%EC%97%AD_2019%EB%85%84_%EC%B4%AC%EC%98%81%28%EC%B6%9C%EC%B2%98_%EB%AC%B8%ED%99%94%EC%9E%AC%EC%B2%AD_%EB%8C%80%EB%B3%80%EC%9D%B8%EC%8B%A4%29.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--seongsan-ilchulbong","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Seongsan Ilchulbong","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p2fefb2608e3","w":1200,"h":750,"o":"gh-p2fefb2608e3.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Seongsan_Ilchulbong_in-game_(Civ7).jpg","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by DevonIsLand on 2026-06-26"}},{"id":"gh-pb575f28b53e","w":1200,"h":750,"o":"gh-pb575f28b53e.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Seongsan_Ilchulbong_in-game_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by DevonIsLand on 2026-06-26"}}]}]}